# BMW 7 Series E38, 1994-2001.
#
# The E38 7-series: 4,984 mm long, 1,862 mm wide, 1,435 mm high, 2,930 mm
# wheelbase; 2.8-4.4 V8 and 5.4 V12. Long low saloon with the slim twin-kidney
# grille and four separate headlamp units. The 7-series family had at least
# 26,900 GB licensed at 1994 Q4 across E32/E38/newer.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_7_Series_(E38)
#
# Colours: Cosmos Black, Aspen Silver, Biarritz Blue and Oxford Green are period
# BMW finishes.
#
# Weight: 30 in total (black 10, silver 9, blue 6, green 5), between the Jaguar
# XJ's 60 and the S-Class W140's 20.
#
# Speed 210 km/h; comfort 160/570 (line).
# Dates: 1994-2001 with a road tail to about 2012.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-e38.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bmw-e38/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

